Description:

Calendar/changes, AddressBook/changes and Mailbox/changes no longer
report a renamed collection as destroyed, and no longer report the same
change on every call with an unchanged state.  Calendar/changes and
AddressBook/changes now honor maxChanges, and AddressBook/changes
reports an addressbook that is no longer shared as destroyed for the
sharee, as the other two methods already did.


